Pristine copy of https://github.com/RigoLigoRLC/unixnu-adreno6xx at 83a0453e981567a30cecd6486bdb8b3b33d64683
(branch unixnu-sm-t733, A642L/SM7325). Top-level sources only; tests omitted.
Licenses: MIT (LICENSE) and GPL-2.0-only files per SPDX header (COPYING).
The nabu A640 changes live in ../../a640 and replace same-named files at build time.
Local deviation: native_legacy_frame_profile_dump is no longer declared or
called in NativeAdrenoPublish.cpp. Upstream declares it weak_import, which the
static nabu kernel link cannot leave undefined, and no nabu object defines it.
Local deviation (2026-10-31, owner probe submit path): NativeAdrenoPublish.cpp
polls a sleeping wait once more after its deadline instead of reporting a
timeout when the completion wakeup is missing; NativeAdrenoUserClient.cpp
freeBo advances the scheduler (as closeOwner does) so a completed job's own
reference is dropped before the unmap; NativeAdrenoScheduler.cpp accept
refuses the buffer range checks of submitResources before reserving a job, so
one bad client IB no longer faults the whole scheduler from advance().
